type: software
title: "A sharp universal skewness bound for unicyclic currents"
authors:
  - family-names: Goyal
    given-names: Dev D.
date-released: 2026-10-29
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A sharp dimension-independent interval for the third-to-first long-time
  cumulant ratio of a marked-edge winding current in a positive-rate
  bidirectional finite ring. The Lean development proves the actual
  finite-matrix derivative theorem and local branch existence.
